          "description": "Render markdown as a typeset, paginated document at a Magzdown URL. Returns the link; hand it to the user as a markdown link instead of pasting the raw markdown. The document is encoded in the URL, nothing is uploaded, so the link is the document: anyone holding it can read the content. Ask the user before creating a link, and do not encode secrets, personal data, or material marked confidential. Keep markdown under about 100 KB.",
